# Source provenance

Follow `AGENTS.md` and `docs/source-provenance.md` throughout this repository.
Do not copy, adapt, port or translate Apache-licensed project material into
Ghost, including source, tests, scanner rules, documentation and assets.
Write Ghost implementations independently from feature requirements; record
origins and retain notices for any other permitted external material.
Do not vendor dependencies or use model output to bypass the no-copy policy.
Separately installed dependencies retain their licenses and need review when
added or redistributed. Do not claim the project is Apache-free or that a
similarity check proves originality.
